CM_ "Baja DAQ CAN spec v0.4 (corner-node topology; diff nodes retired Oct 20 2026; heartbeat NodeId byte dropped Oct 26 2026; v0 frozen Oct 19 2026). CAN 2.0A, 1 Mbit/s, little-endian. All-ones raw value (0xFF, 0xFFFF, 0x7FFF signed) = not available. Owner: Toph Jones.";
CM_ SG_ 16 Seq "Sequence counter, +1 per message on this ID, wraps 255->0";
CM_ SG_ 16 SinceSync "us since last SYNC (0x080); 0xFFFF = no SYNC yet";
CM_ BO_ 16 "Sent on change, then 10 Hz while active";
CM_ BO_ 128 "No header. Nodes reset their us counter on receipt";
CM_ BO_ 144 "No header. Sent on PPS";
